            <field>
              <name>FRCHFRC2</name>
              <description>Force HFRC2 On.Setting this bit forces HFRC2 to remain on, including in deep sleep. When changing a module's clock source to HFRC2, this bit must be set and remain set when any module is using HFRC2 as its clock.</description>
