              <description>DSP 1 IDMA Cross Trigger Source. All enabled sources are ANDed to generate a trigger enable. \n Bit30-12:IRQ18-0 Bit11: IDMATRIGPULSE, Bit10: DSP Timer1, Bit9: DSP Timer0, Bit8: alternate DSP iDMA trigger out</description>
