2: HFRC_96MHz div4</description>
              <bitRange>[2:1]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>

            </field>
            <field>
              <name>CLKEN</name>
              <description>PDM Clock enable.
If multiple clocks are enabled, priority is HFRC2, HF XTAL, HFRC.</description>
