16 to 64 allowed.
96 allowed for special configuration.</description>
              <bitRange>[20:14]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>

            </field>
            <field>
              <name>MCLKDIV</name>
              <description>PDMA_CKO frequency divisor.
MCLKDIV > 0. MCLKDIV = 0 PROHIBITED.
MCLKDIV = (PDM_CLK /Fsin / (DIVMCLKQ + 1)) -1</description>
              <bitRange>[13:10]</bitRange>
